rporated questions and answers in the catechism so that the basics of Christian faith would not just be learned by rote, "the way monkeys do it", but understood.', 'question': 'Topic: Martin Luther\nWhat did Luther devise to teach  Christianity to the congregation?', 'answer': 'catechism'}, {'title': 'Martin Luther', 'context': 'Luther devised the catechism as a method of imparting the basics of Christianity to the congregations. In 1529, he wrote the Large Catechism, a manual for pastors and teachers, as well as a synopsis, the Small Catechism, to be memorised by the people themselves. The catechisms provided easy-to-understand instructional and devotional material on the Ten Commandments, the Apostles\' Creed, the Lord\'s Prayer, baptism, and the Lord\'s Supper. Luther incorporated questions and answers in the catechism so that the basics of Christian faith would not just be learned by rote, "the way monkeys do it", but understood.', 'question': 'Topic: Martin Luther\nWhen did Luther write the Large Catechism?', 'answer': '1529'}, {'title': 'Martin Luther', 'context': 'Luther devised the catechism as a method of imparting the basics of Christianity to the congregations. In 1529, he wrote the Large Catechism, a manual for pastors and teachers, as well as a synopsis, the Small Catechism, to be memorised by the people themselves. The catechisms provided easy-to-understand instructional and devotional material on the Ten Commandments, the Apostles\' Creed, the Lord\'s Prayer, baptism, and the Lord\'s Supper. Luther incorporated questions and answers in the catechism so that the basics of Christian faith would not just be learned by rote, "the way monkeys do it", but understood.', 'question': 'Topic: Martin Luther\nTo whom was the Large Catechism directed?', 'answer': 'pastors and teachers'}, {'title': 'Martin Luther', 'context': 'Luther devised the catechism as a method of imparting the basics of Christianity to the congregations. In 1529, he wrote the Large Catechism