08:59:34 [INFO] root - Received request: {'train_sequences': ['Steam engine\n1. Steam engines have lower power-to-weight ratios compared to internal combustion engines.', 'Steam engine\n2. Mobile applications have largely shifted away from steam engines due to this limitation.', 'Steam engine\n3. Steam power is still dependent on the weight of boilers and condensers.', 'Steam engine\n4. Electric power generation heavily relies on steam turbines, making it a major factor in industry.', 'Steam engine\n5. Recent concerns about fuel sources and pollution have led to a renewed interest in steam power.', 'Steam engine\n6. The Advanced Steam movement aims to explore the potential of steam as a component of cogeneration processes and as a prime mover.', 'Steam engine\n7. There is a growing interest in utilizing steam technology to address the challenges of fuel sources and pollution.', "Steam engine\nThe weight of boilers and condensers generally makes the power-to-weight ratio of a steam plant lower than for internal combustion engines. For mobile applications steam has been largely superseded by internal combustion engines or electric motors. However, most electric power is generated using steam turbine plant, so that indirectly the world's industry is still dependent on steam power. Recent concerns about fuel sources and pollution have incited a renewed interest in steam both as a component of cogeneration processes and as a prime mover. This is becoming known as the Advanced Steam movement.[citation needed]"], 'eval_questions': [{'title': 'Steam engine', 'context': "The weight of boilers and condensers generally makes the power-to-weight ratio of a steam plant lower than for internal combustion engines. For mobile applications steam has been largely superseded by internal combustion engines or electric motors. However, most electric power is generated using steam turbine plant, so that indirectly the world's industry is still dependent on steam power. Recent concerns about fuel sources and pollution have incited a renewed interest in steam both as a component of cogeneration processes and as a prime mover. This is becoming known as the Advanced Steam movement.[citation needed]", 'question': 'Topic: Steam engine\nWhat is the power-to-weight ratio of a steam plant compared to that of an internal combustion engine?', 'answer': 'lower'}, {'title': 'Steam engine', 'context': "The weight of boilers and condensers generally makes the power-to-weight ratio of a steam plant lower than for internal combustion engines. For mobile applications steam has been largely superseded by internal combustion engines or electric motors. However, most electric power is generated using steam turbine plant, so that indirectly the world's industry is still dependent on steam power. Recent concerns about fuel sources and pollution have incited a renewed interest in steam both as a component of cogeneration processes and as a prime mover. This is becoming known as the Advanced Steam movement.[citation needed]", 'question': 'Topic: Steam engine\nAlong with internal combustion engines, what machines have superseded steam in some areas?', 'answer': 'electric motors'}, {'title': 'Steam engine', 'context': "The weight of boilers and condensers generally makes the power-to-weight ratio of a steam plant lower than for internal combustion engines. For mobile applications steam has been largely superseded by internal combustion engines or electric motors. However, most electric power is generated using steam turbine plant, so that indirectly the world's industry is still dependent on steam power. Recent concerns about fuel sources and pollution have incited a renewed interest in steam both as a component of cogeneration processes and as a prime mover. This is becoming known as the Advanced Steam movement.[citation needed]", 'question': 'Topic: Steam engine\nWhat plants create most electric power?', 'answer': 'steam turbine'}, {'title': 'Steam engine', 'context': "The weight of boilers and condensers generally makes the power-to-weight ratio of a steam plant lower than for internal combustion engines. For mobile applications steam has been largely superseded by internal combustion engines or electric motors. However, most electric power is generated using steam turbine plant, so that indirectly the world's industry is still dependent on steam power. Recent concerns about fuel sources and pollution have incited a renewed interest in steam both as a component of cogeneration processes and as a prime mover. This is becoming known as the Advanced Steam movement.[citation needed]", 'question': 'Topic: Steam engine\nWhat is the name of the movement that seeks renewed use of steam power in the modern era?', 'answer': 'Advanced Steam'}, {'title': 'Steam engine', 'context': "The weight of boilers and condensers generally makes the power-to-weight ratio of a steam plant lower than for internal combustion engines. For mobile applications steam has been largely superseded by internal combustion engines or electric motors. However, most electric power is generated using steam turbine plant, so that indirectly the world's industry is still dependent on steam power. Recent concerns about fuel sources and pollution have incited a renewed interest in steam both as a component of cogeneration processes and as a prime mover. This is becoming known as the Advanced Steam movement.[citation needed]", 'question': 'Topic: Steam engine\nAlong with fuel sources, what concern has contributed to the development of the Advanced Steam movement?', 'answer': 'pollution'}], 'lora_rank': 32, 'lora_alpha': 64, 'lora_dropout': 0.0, 'finetune_epochs': 10, 'finetune_lr': 0.001, 'batch_size': 1, 'gradient_accumulation_steps': 1, 'end_mask_substring': ''}
